# fixtures/hex/fragments/schema/items.hex: schema item records ([F08 §8.5]) of every class, in item key order
# ([F08 §8.5] "Item key order": class, then the key's names bytewise), as a view's SCHEMA section ([F09 §8.3]) or a
# Schema op's `new` ([F06 §7.6]) carries them; decode as item records to the end of the file. The stores hold only
# a kind (class 1), an enumeration value (class 3) and a named query (class 5) (fixtures/hex/store-a); this file adds
# field items (class 2: a default with a range, `optional`, `index`, `coerce`, the `one_line` and `ascii` flags),
# enumeration values with a lattice (`covers`) and the `side` and `done` flags, an edge kind (class 4: `KindSet`s
# with a core bit and an ext bit for project kind 64, reverse names, a reading), and a retired item (iflags bit 0).
# Symbol ids of class `name` are this fragment's own, dense in first-use order (each is named where it is used);
# store-local ids: project kind `incident` = 64, edge kind `escalates_to` = 64.

